DESCRIPTION=Unified in-flight channel sidecar (fl_channel_sidecar_t) for file and message transfers: 5-byte MSB-first prefix, share/transfer id, expires_at, sender/receiver member ids, center_freq_hz (#279 hook), FILE_META/MSG_META wire rev 1; host relay strips in-flight sidecar; clients emit MSG_META before MSG; catalog pending/commit for message sidecar; host SQLite catalog (server_shared/host_catalog.db) with SHA-256 content-hash fetch, per-transfer_id member ACL (duplicate content_hash allowed), full-blob read enforcement, public/expiry/revoke for hub file and message storage; server_shared lands offered file_name (numeric (n) suffix on collision), host <landed>.meta for share_id/expiry purge into expired/; catalog checkpoint on host promote and import_handoff; server file fetch by hash allocates full payload; fl_net_endpoint_t parse/bind/connect (#280 hosted dual-stack foundation: native IPv6 bracket parse, v6 loopback host/join, endpoint-aware sockets); fl_net_server_addr_t peer_addr on members and local_ep-only client bind (#283); OP_CTRL_HOST_PROMOTE6 (0x24) client dispatch with host_addr (fl_net_addr_t) on event callback, contract_p3_host_promote6.h, fl_net_session_decode_host_promote, opcode_to_event PROMOTE6 fix, native-v6 successor emit (#283); P3-11 IPv6 foundation (#280): contract_p3_ipv6.h, net_ipv6/icmpv6/ndp, IPv6 FIB (route_add6/lookup6), loopback ICMPv6 echo + NDP NS/NA, ethertype 0x86DD dispatch, fl_net_dns_resolve_aaaa for localhost; session wire big-endian norm (#284), fl_net_htons/htonl in net_udp/net_background/tests; OP_CTRL_HOST_PROMOTE memcpy/nbo decode (#284); session_mutex guards promote without blocking under lock (#285); Python host_catalog.db integration test; tracks #239 server file/msg hub

RELEASE_DATE=2026-06-01
